cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Le Chapeau: An A/B Testing Platform for Socratic AI in Education"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
url: "https://github.com/mickaeltemporao/paper-socrates"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mickaeltemporao/paper-socrates"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - family-names: "Temporão"
    given-names: "Mickael"
abstract: >-
  Le Chapeau is a turnkey experimental platform designed for educational and
  behavioral researchers to deploy controlled web chat applications comparing
  AI interaction paradigms (such as baseline control, direct instructional assistant,
  and Socratic questioning tutor) with real-time data persistence and salted
  deterministic anonymization.
keywords:
  - "artificial intelligence"
  - "education"
  - "socratic method"
  - "a/b testing"
  - "educational technology"
  - "large language models"
  - "pedagogical agents"
